                        "review": "Let's face it, people like this series because of the first game. The first was campy and cringeworthy, but it was at least fun at times. The second game was awful. This one is somewhere in the middle. But the first was far from a masterpiece. It was a bad game, but a FUN bad game. This one is just mediocre in every way possible and killed my love for the series. It might be worth it if you're HEAVILY invested in the series, but it's just underwhelming in every way imaginable.\n\n5/10",
